    "## 8. Training\n",
    "\n",
    "* **Mini-batches** of 16 with `drop_last`, so BatchNorm never sees a tiny final batch.\n",
    "* AdamW, warm-up + cosine schedule, label smoothing, gradient clipping.\n",
    "* After each epoch the **validation** set is scored. The weights with the **lowest validation loss** are kept. Loss is used rather than accuracy because, with 18 images, accuracy moves in coarse 5.6-point steps.\n",
    "* **Early stopping** after 20 epochs without improvement; the best weights are then restored.\n",
    "* **Test-time augmentation (TTA)** for the final evaluation: average the softmax of the original, horizontally flipped and vertically flipped image."
   ]
  },
