   "source": [
    "**Reading the results.** The cross-validated accuracy (87.5 %, 95 % CI 80–92 %) is consistent with the hold-out test (78 %, 95 % CI 55–91 %); the intervals overlap widely, and cross-validation uses all 120 images, so it is the more reliable estimate. **Brown spot** is the hardest class.\n",
