    "### Limitations\n",
    "* **Tiny dataset:** 120 images from essentially one source. Accuracy on real field photos (cluttered backgrounds, other cameras) will be lower.\n",
    "* **Possible shortcut:** every Bacterial-leaf-blight image shares one resolution (see section 2).\n",
    "* **Closed world:** healthy leaves and other diseases are always forced into one of the three classes.\n",
    "* **Next steps:** more data, two convolutions per block, higher resolution for small lesions, mixup, probability calibration, and Grad-CAM to show where the model looks.\n",
    "\n",
    ]
  }
